msgstr "Identifiant Google Analytics (GA4)"

msgid "e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX. Only needed if not already loaded through GTM above."
msgstr "ex. G-XXXXXXXXXX. Nécessaire uniquement si non déjà chargé via GTM ci-dessus."

